{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Decision recorded 2026-10-27 (operator): ship an idempotent ensure-registry migration (docs/migrations.md) that selects tickets whose SNAPSHOT carries force_close_reason with last_reopened_at set (or force_close_reason on a non-closed status) and rebuilds them with rebuild_snapshot_from_full_log. It runs on the first write after the change merges."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793146910342070312,"uuid":"9a9f46f4-f279-47cc-b85a-84f03162b596"}